  "translations": {
    "en_US": {
      "description": "This mod was designed to bring various improvements to BG2 rules. Among the components: a profile (Sword Angel); a rebalancing of shapeshifters in a more reasonable way than Ease-of-Use Mod Collection; armor refinement with weight consideration, failure on profane spells and thief skills; and finally completely remodeled HLAs to make them more unique to each class and profile.",
      "components": {
        "choice_0": "Revised High Level Abilities",
        "10": "Install revised HLAs for all classes",
        "11": "Choose which classes get revised HLAs",
        "101": "Fighter HLAs",
        "102": "Barbarian HLAs",
        "103": "Ranger HLAs",
        "104": "Paladin HLAs",
        "105": "Cleric HLAs",
        "106": "Druid HLAs",
        "107": "Monk HLAs",
        "108": "Wizard HLAs",
        "109": "Bard HLAs",
        "110": "Thief HLAs",
        "choice_1": "\"SwashImoen\"",
        "20": "\"SwashImoen\", full revision (suggested)",
        "21": "\"SwashImoen\", simple kit change (undocumented)",
        "22": "\"SwashImoen\", points in Detect Illusions rather than Set Traps.",
        "choice_2": "Shapeshifting fix",
        "30": "Heal on shifting back to human (Default)",
        "31": "Heal on shifting to animal (by Borsook)",
        "40": "Universal lesser mage robes",
        "50": "Sword Angel - New Fighter Kit",
        "choice_3": "Revised Armors & Shields",
